PTX CoRR+relaxed.gpu+generic-shared
"Two relaxed reads of a shared location through generic addresses, at .gpu"
{
x=0 @cta 0;
P1:r0=0;
P1:r1=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0 | P1@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0 ;
 st.relaxed.gpu x, 1      | ld.relaxed.gpu r0, x     ;
                          | ld.relaxed.gpu r1, x     ;
exists
(P1:r0 == 1 /\ P1:r1 == 0)
